  IsWeared: Selected
  TakeAPet: Take a pet!
  TaskCompletedNotification: Task complete!
  CollectRewardNotification: Collect reward
  TaskTableTitle: Tasks
  TaskTranslates:
  - Type: 0
    TaskText: Fly {0} m.
  - Type: 1
    TaskText: Collect {0} boosts.
  - Type: 2
    TaskText: Collect {0} coins.
  - Type: 3
    TaskText: Bet {0} your mom money.
  Meters: m
  You: You
  TutorTranslates:
  - Id: hello
    Phrase: Hey there! You've entered an amazing adventure world! Get ready for fun,
      challenges and lots of coins!
  - Id: movement
    Phrase: 'Look how easy it is! Use the joystick or keyboard arrows to move. Try
      taking a step forward!  '
  - Id: flyExplain
    Phrase: 'Your goal is to fly as far as you can, dodge traps and set new records
      every time!  '
  - Id: betZone
    Phrase: 'See that glowing zone? The longer you stand there, the more coins you
      get. Let''s try it!  '
  - Id: x2Flight
    Phrase: 'Now run to the x2 zone - it doubles your winnings!  '
  - Id: startZone
    Phrase: 'Run to the start zone, let''s begin our adventure!  '
  - Id: fall
    Phrase: 'Oops! Fell down? Don''t worry, it happens! Get up and try again - you
      can do it!  '
  - Id: success
    Phrase: 'Yay! You did it! Your first coins are waiting. Go grab your reward!  '
  - Id: shield
    Phrase: 'Upgrade your shield. Now your coins are safe even in traps!  '
  - Id: petOpening
    Phrase: 'Cool pets and awesome skins live here! Wanna see? Let''s open your first
      friend!  '
  - Id: cutePet
    Phrase: 'Wow! Look how cute! Now he''ll travel with you and help you earn more
      coins!  '
  - Id: miniGames
    Phrase: 'Also here: parkour, basketball, trampolines and music games! All in
      one place!  '
  - Id: rangStatus
    Phrase: 'Look at the screen: skills on the right, rank below. More coins = cooler
      status!  '
  - Id: goodLuck
    Phrase: 'You''re a real player now! Tutorial done. Go explore, win and have fun.
      Good luck, champ!  '
  UpgradeName:
  - Type: 0
    Name: Multiplier
  - Type: 1
    Name: Magnet
  - Type: 2
    Name: Lucky
  - Type: 3
    Name: Predict
  - Type: 4
    Name: Defence
  BotsPhrases:
  - hey
  - hey there
  - heyo
  - yo
  - ey
  - sup
  - hi
  - hello
  - well, hey
  - listen
  - hold on a sec
  - wait up
  - ah, there you are
  - been here long?
  - you come here often?
  - you new here?
  SkinNameTranslates:
